## C9.1 finite product arena

取有限 charge set $C$，$|C|=c$，有限 phase set $P$，$|P|=p$。状态空间为：

$$
\Omega=C\times P.
\tag{C9.1}
$$

假设 charge observer 完全区分 $C$。某个有限 phase observer family 将 $P$ 分成等价类：

$$
P=P_1\sqcup\cdots\sqcup P_r,
\qquad
|P_j|=n_j.
\tag{C9.2}
$$

